cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "prevol"
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite the repository with its release tag.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "de La Fournière"
    given-names: "Brieuc"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Arithmon/Prevol"
abstract: >-
  Audit the declarations that a computational result carries, and check they
  are still true. A result should not travel alone: it should travel with the
  conditions under which it was produced and with the means to check what one
  is entitled to conclude from it. prevol audits an archive of claim-bearing
  artifacts for producer freshness, counter coherence, provenance pins that
  still resolve to their declared hashes, and partial runs occupying the place
  of authoritative results. All checks are read-only, because an archive of
  hash-pinned artifacts is append-only by construction.
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - research software
  - scientific computing
  - verification
  - negative controls
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-29"
